Navātman Seed,Metaphysical Association,The 9 Internal Resonances (The 81-fold Grid)
HA (ह),Śiva / Space,H1​ to H9​: The 9 stages of initial vibration.
SA (स),Śakti / Totality,S1​ to S9​: The 9 stages of divine power.
KṢA (क्ष),Kāla / Time,Kṣ1​ to Kṣ9​: The 9 stages of temporal sequencing.
MA (म),Māyā / Illusion,M1​ to M9​: The 9 stages of limitation/measurement.
LA (ल),Pṛthivī / Earth,L1​ to L9​: The 9 stages of solid manifestation.
VA (व),Ap / Water,V1​ to V9​: The 9 stages of flow and cohesion.
YA (य),Vāyu / Air,Y1​ to Y9​: The 9 stages of movement and touch.
RA (र),Tejas / Fire,R1​ to R9​: The 9 stages of heat and light.
ŪM (ऊँ),The Bindu / Void,U1​ to U9​: The 9 stages of final absorption.

